### Create MCQ
POST http://localhost:8000/mcq/add_mcq
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "mcq_question": "What is JavaScript?",
    "mcq_options": ["Language", "Library", "Framework", "Database"],
    "mcq_answer": "Language",
    "mcq_tag": ["Programming", "Frontend"]
}

### Get All MCQs
GET http://localhost:8000/mcq/get_all_mcqs


### Update MCQ
PUT http://localhost:8000/mcq/update_mcq
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "test_mcq_id": "8ffd4d6b-9de0-4b18-b4bc-3bde05ced2b0",
    "mcq_question": "What is JavaScript?",
    "mcq_options": ["Option A", "Option B", "Option C", "Option D"],
    "mcq_answer": "Option A",
    "mcq_tag": ["Updated"]
}

### Delete MCQ
DELETE http://localhost:8000/mcq/remove_mcq
Content-Type: application/json

{
"test_mcq_id": "8ffd4d6b-9de0-4b18-b4bc-3bde05ced2b0"
}
